    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Saulo akusimangana ni Samuele",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵapali mundu jwine jwakupikanika soni jwakupikanika lina lyakwe Kishi jwa lukosyo lwa Benjamini mwanace jwa Abiyele nipo ŵaliji cisukulu ca Seloli ca liŵasa lya Bekolati, juŵaliji soni jwa mbali ja liŵele lya Afiya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwele munduju ŵakwete mwanace jwamlume lina lyakwe Saulo, ŵaliji jwakusalala mnope. Sikati ja Aisalaeli wosope, paliji pangali mcanda jwakusalala kumpunda jwalakwejo. Saulo ŵaliji jwamlewu mwakuti ŵandu wosope ŵamlecesyaga m'makoyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acibulu ŵane ŵa Kishi ŵasoŵile, myoyo ŵamsalile Saulo kuti, “Mumjigale jumo jwa ŵa masengoŵa ni mlongane najo kuja kukulolesya acibuluwo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanjajo ŵajawile kupeleta cilambo camatumbi ca Efelemu ni dela ja Shalisha, nambo kweleko kwaliji kwangali. Myoyo ŵajawile kupunda ku dela ja Shalimu, nambo acibuluwo kwaliji kwangali kweleko. Kaneko ŵajawile kupunda dela ja Benjamini, nambope nganiŵasimana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵayice ku dela ja Sufi, Saulo ŵatite kwa jwamasengo jwakwe, “Kwende tuwujile kumusi, nimkaŵa baba ŵangu kuleka kuganisya ya acibulu ni kutanda kutudandawula uwe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwamasengo jula ŵajanjile kuti, “Ajembecele kaje. Mwana mundu jwa Mlungu mu msinda muno jwakwete ucimbicimbi wekulungwa ligongo cilicose citaŵecete cikusicitendekaga. Kwende tujawule kwa jwalakwejo mwine mwakwe takapakombole kutusalila kwali acibuluwo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo ŵawusisye kuti, “Naga tujawule kwa jwalakwejo, ana tukapakombole kumpa cici, pakuti mkate wa m'misaku mwetu umasile, nipo nganitukola cilicose cakumpa mundu jwa Mlungujo, ana tutukampe cici?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jwamasengo jula jwajanjile kuti, “Une ngwete kambiya kamnono ka silifa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " nipo tingampe mundu jwa Mlungujo, nipo takatusalile kwapite acibuluwo.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo ŵajanjile kuti, “Lwele ni lunda, kwende tujawule.” Myoyo ŵajawile ku msinda kuŵatamaga mundu jwa Mlungujo. Piŵakwelega litumbi kwawula ku msindako, ŵasimangene nawo ŵali ŵane ŵiŵajawulaga kukuteka mesi. Jemanjajo ŵawusisye ŵaliwo kuti, “Ana mundu jwakulocesya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.9+1SA.9.10+1SA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.9",
              "1SA.9.10",
              "1SA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " jula ali mu msinda m'mumu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.9+1SA.9.10+1SA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.9",
              "1SA.9.10",
              "1SA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Pa jele ndaŵijo jwakulocesya jwakolanjidwaga kuti jwakulola ya msogolo, myoyo naga jwine akusosa kumwusya Mlungu ciwusyo, ŵatiji kuti, “Kwende tujawule kwa jwakulola ya msogolo.”)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.9+1SA.9.10+1SA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.9",
              "1SA.9.10",
              "1SA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.9+1SA.9.10+1SA.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.9",
              "1SA.9.10",
              "1SA.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Elo ali kukoko,” ŵali ŵala ŵajanjile myoyo. “Apano akwenda pasogolo pawo. Ajanguye tamsimane. Pitagambe kwinjila mu msindamo, basi tiŵasimane. Womwanjawo ayice lelo mu msinda muno, ligongo ŵandu akwawula kumalo gakupelecela mbopesi kwitumbi kukupeleka mbopesi. Jwalakwejo apite kukulya pamo ni ŵandu ŵaŵilanjidwe, ligongo ŵanduwo ngaŵa mkutanda kulya mpaka jwalakwejo ali ayice kweleko, pakuŵapo jwalakwe ni jutatande kupeleka upile ku mbopesijo. Naga ajawule sambano jino takasimane mkanajawule.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.12+1SA.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.12",
              "1SA.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Saulo ni jwamasengojo ŵapitilisye kwawula ku msindako, nipo piŵajinjilaga, ŵam'weni Samuele ali mkopoka mu msindamo ali mkwisa kwa jemanjajo pa litala lyakwawula ku malo gakulambila kula.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo mwa liso lyakwe AMBUJE ŵamsalile Samuele kuti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Malaŵi ndaŵi mpela ajino, tinjimtumicisya mundu jwakutyocela ku lukosyo lwa Benjamini. Jwelejo timumjinjisye ucimwene kuti ŵalongoleleje ŵandu ŵangu Aisalaeli, nipo jwalakwe tacakulupusya jemanjajo kwa Afilisiti. Nakuweni kulaga kwa ŵandu ŵangu nipo nakupikene kulila kwawo pakuti akusoŵa cikamucisyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuele piŵam'weni Saulo, AMBUJE ŵamsalile kuti, “Aju ni mundu junamsalile jula. Tacalamulila ŵandu ŵangu.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko Saulo ŵajawile kwa Samuele, juŵaŵandicile ku cipata, nipo ŵamwusisye kuti, “Asalile, ana mundu jwakulocesya akusatamaga kwapi?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuele ŵajanjile kuti, “Jwakulocesyajo ni une jwene. Longolelani mjawule ku malo gakulambila. Wosope ŵaŵili mumŵelele timkalye pamo ni une lelo. Malaŵi kundaŵi tinjimsalila yosope yili kumtima kwenu kaneko tinjimkunda kuti mjawuleje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwamba ya acibulu ŵasokonecele masiku gatatu gapitega, mkasimwadandawula, apatikene kala. Nambo kuti ana ŵani ŵakusosedwa mnope ni Aisalaeli? Ana ngaŵaga m'mwejope ni liŵasa lyosope lya baba ŵenu?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Saulo ŵajanjile kuti, “Une ngutyocela ku lukosyo lwalunondi mnope mu Isalaeli, lukosyo lwa Benjamini, nipo liŵasa lyangu lili lyangapikanika kose mu lukosyomo. Nambi ligongo cici wawo akuŵeceta camti myiyi kwa une?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaneko Samuele ŵamlongolele Saulo ni jwamasengo jwakwe jula mcipinda cacikulungwa nipo ŵapele malo pasogolo pa ŵandu ŵakuŵilanjidwa ŵala. Wosope ŵene pampepe ŵaliji makumi gatatu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Samuele ŵamsalile jwakuteleka kuti, “Myice najo nyama jinimpele jila, jinamsalile kuti mjisalasye.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo jwakuteleka jula jwasagwile lukongolo lya nyama nipo ŵajipelece kwa Saulo. Samuele ŵatite kuti, “Naji nyama jinamsunjile jila, mlye jelejo. Namsalacisye kuti mlye ndaŵi ajino pamo ni ŵandu ŵinaŵilasile.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo Saulo ŵalile ni Samuele lyele lisikulyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Piŵatulukaga kutyocela ku malo gakulambila kwawula ku msinda, ŵamlinganyicisye Saulo malo gagona penani pa msakasa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nipo jwalakwe ŵagonile pelepo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Samuele akumjinjisya Saulo ucimwene pakumtaga mawuta",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kumasikusiku Samuele ŵamŵilasile Saulo pa msakasa pala kuti, “Jimukani, nimpecesye ngamlecele apo.” Papopo Saulo ŵajimwice, nipo wosope ŵaŵiliwo ŵatandite kwenda yalumo mu msewu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1SA 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali ayice kumbesi kwa msindawo, Samuele ŵatite kwa Saulo, “Mumsalile jwamasengo jwenujo alongoleleje kaje.” Jwamasengojo jwalongolele, nipo Samuele ŵapitilisye kumsalila Saulo kuti, “M'mwejope jimani panandi, kuti nimsalile yaŵecete Mlungu.” Jwamasengo jula jwalongolele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1SA.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1SA.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
